OL,3,GNEWSA'Hogspital' founder saddened by
OL,4,Aintake pause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a "hogspital" says she
OL,7,Ffeels "exhausted and sad" that she has
OL,8,Fhad to close hedgehog admissions.
OL,10,FVal Saunders, who runs Hoggieworts
OL,11,FHedgehog Helpers, in Wellingborough,
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, said she has been
OL,13,F"completely overwhelmed by the
OL,14,Favalanche of tiny hedgehogs arriving".
OL,16,FShe said she ideally had space for 16
OL,17,Fhedgehogs, but as she was currently
OL,18,Fcaring for 24 it meant she could not
OL,19,Ftake in any more.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
