OL,3,GNEWSA'Hogspital' founder saddened by
OL,4,Aintake pause
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimals In Need, a
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire-based charity, said it
OL,8,Fwas also "inundated" and was currently
OL,9,Fcaring for about 50 animals.
